Here's the problem file for preparing the payload (potato) based on the given domain and task:

```pddl
(define (problem prepare_potato_problem)
  (:domain robot1)
  (:objects
    robot1 - robot
    potato - object
    plate - object
    counterTop - object
  )
  (:init
    (not (inaction robot1))
    (at robot1 counterTop)
    (at-location potato counterTop)
    (at-location plate counterTop)
  )
  (:goal
    (and
      (at-location potato plate)
    )
  )
)
```

Problem file generation is done.